---
description: Shield KYA is the sole PEP. Dual-plane host labels. Offline eval is a sample fixture.
alwaysApply: false
---

- Before irreversible tool side effects, evaluate through Shield KYA (`ALLOW` | `DENY` | `REQUIRE_APPROVE`).
- Missing `APPROVED` means the side effect does not run.
- Label `host=ide` (authoring) or `host=runtime` (production). Same identity and trail on both.
- Offline `eval-tool --offline` / `dash --once --offline` are sample fixtures, not production enforcement.
- Scanners and ORR reports are evidence only. They never ALLOW.
